-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

In the v0.9.0 named as the FIRST USABLE Version
there are a lot of new features and errors that make the
shell usable by users day by day withouth errors.

------------
FEATURES
------------

The features presented in v0.9.0 tried to make Knight Shell
better than before and made the user feel comfortable:

1. Memory Pointers Errors Fixed.
2. Presented the Support of Bash Scripting config File for Prompt Personalization.
3. Directory Movement Permited in this Version.

